## Exp40 — Multi-Horizon Active-Corridor Competing-Risk Family — FULL PASS

Frozen horizons: `15m / 30m / 60m / 120m`.

Frozen competing-risk target:

```text
NO_EXIT
ADVANCE first by future M5 CLOSE
RECAPTURE first by future M5 CLOSE
```

Models fit separately by horizon using TRAIN only:

```text
CONST_H
POSITION_H = geo_logit(CorridorPosition)
SEMI_H     = geo_logit(CorridorPosition) + log1p(DwellBars)
```

Exact Exp40 evaluation coverage:

```text
TRAIN      21681/22448 cells = 96.58%
VALIDATION  7577/ 7836 cells = 96.69%
TEST        8008/ 8384 cells = 95.52%
```

TEST class depth:

```text
15m  NO_EXIT 77.50% | ADV  8.48% | REC 14.02%
30m  NO_EXIT 64.47% | ADV 14.17% | REC 21.36%
60m  NO_EXIT 50.30% | ADV 21.08% | REC 28.62%
120m NO_EXIT 33.14% | ADV 28.87% | REC 37.99%
```

Dwell coefficients were negative for both causes at all horizons:

```text
15m  ADV -0.691865 | REC -0.525664
30m  ADV -0.708940 | REC -0.519087
60m  ADV -0.754371 | REC -0.580955
120m ADV -0.714698 | REC -0.593600
```

Frozen pooled primary inference:

```text
