Formal:

```text
EXP40_COVERAGE_FORMAL = PASS
MULTI_HORIZON_POSITION_CORE = PASS
MULTI_HORIZON_DWELL_INCREMENT = PASS
FULL_MULTI_HORIZON_CORRIDOR_DNA = PASS
POSITION_TEMPORAL_DEPTH = CONFIRMED_IN_HISTORICAL_OOS
DWELL_TEMPORAL_DEPTH = CONFIRMED_IN_HISTORICAL_OOS
```

Mechanistic diagnostic: Dwell strongly improves EXIT AUC while SIDE AUC remains nearly unchanged, supporting:

```text
CorridorPosition -> WHICH SIDE
Dwell            -> WHEN / WHETHER EXIT
```

Exp40 does not retroactively change Exp21's one-step formal status.

